Elektrisk motor</span></a></li><li><a href="#carConfigSpecsSafety" class=""><span class="Text__apheleia-h5--j80jX Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Sikkerhet</span></a></li><li><a href="#carConfigSpecsStyling" class=""><span class="Text__apheleia-h5--j80jX Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Styling</span></a></li><li><a href="#carConfigSpecsPerformance" class=""><span class="Text__apheleia-h5--j80jX Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Ytelse</span></a></li><li><a href="#carConfigSpecsComfort" class=""><span class="Text__apheleia-h5--j80jX Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Komfort</span></a></li><li><a href="#carConfigSpecsMultimedia" class=""><span class="Text__apheleia-h5--j80jX Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Multimedia</span></a></li></ul></nav></section><section class="SpecsAndHighlights__contentContainer--bZEd8"><div class="BackButton__button--ZgdMf BackButton__xs--DEu6t"><a as="a" href="https://www.toyota.no/nybil/bz4x-touring#aphgradeselector" class="Button__btn-text--e6koK"><svg class="Icon__icon--gk3vW Icon__sm--LLCLr Icon__icon--gk3vW Icon__icon-arrow-left--Gw8AF" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#arrow-left"></use></svg><span>Tilbake til modellsiden</span></a></div><h1 class="Text__header-regular--ITTjn Text__heading-global--rDWeu SpecsAndHighlights__specsHeading--J7h2M"><span>bZ4X Touring Executive 20 AWD specifications</span></h1><div id="highlights-top" class="SpecsAndHighlights__highlightsSection--eD1OL"><p class="Text__support-header-semibold--ok4zj Text__heading-global--rDWeu ColorTypes__grey-7--Vl83B"><span>Høydepunkter</span></p><div class="HighlightsSlider__highlights-slider--ArZRs"><div class="HighlightsSlider__slider--zxEcA"><article class="HighlightsSlider__slide--HQmmc"><h3 class="Text__header-regular--ITTjn Text__heading-global--rDWeu">20-tommer alu.felger: Felger som tiltrekker seg blikk</h3><figure><img src="https://t1-carassets.toyota-europe.com/8d7a41e5-b9d4-49c6-9f5f-1d39144a906e.JPG" srcSet="https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/180X180/8d7a41e5-b9d4-49c6-9f5f-1d39144a906e.webp 180w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/225X225/8d7a41e5-b9d4-49c6-9f5f-1d39144a906e.webp 225w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/336X336/8d7a41e5-b9d4-49c6-9f5f-1d39144a906e.webp 336w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/386X386/8d7a41e5-b9d4-49c6-9f5f-1d39144a906e.webp 386w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/426X426/8d7a41e5-b9d4-49c6-9f5f-1d39144a906e.webp 426w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/772X772/8d7a41e5-b9d4-49c6-9f5f-1d39144a906e.webp 772w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/852X852/8d7a41e5-b9d4-49c6-9f5f-1d39144a906e.webp 852w" alt="" role="presentation" loading="lazy" draggable="false"/></figure><div class="TruncatedText__container--HTs4n" id="text-content-:R1ipqd:"><input type="checkbox" class="TruncatedText__checkbox--VgXyK" id="read-more-toggle-:R1ipqd:" disabled=""/><div class="TruncatedText__text--jvlzh"><div><p>Robuste 20-tommers alu.felger, med sporty navkapsler og et design med 5 doble eiker, disse løfter kjøregenskapene for dynamisk kjøring</p></div></div></div></article><article class="HighlightsSlider__slide--HQmmc"><h3 class="Text__header-regular--ITTjn Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Innebygde ladere: Lad opp! </h3><figure><img src="https://t1-carassets.toyota-europe.com/5dabe176-8b1f-41c4-a6c0-39dad292fd6e.JPG" srcSet="https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/180X180/5dabe176-8b1f-41c4-a6c0-39dad292fd6e.webp 180w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/225X225/5dabe176-8b1f-41c4-a6c0-39dad292fd6e.webp 225w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/336X336/5dabe176-8b1f-41c4-a6c0-39dad292fd6e.webp 336w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/386X386/5dabe176-8b1f-41c4-a6c0-39dad292fd6e.webp 386w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/426X426/5dabe176-8b1f-41c4-a6c0-39dad292fd6e.webp 426w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/772X772/5dabe176-8b1f-41c4-a6c0-39dad292fd6e.webp 772w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/852X852/5dabe176-8b1f-41c4-a6c0-39dad292fd6e.webp 852w" alt="" role="presentation" loading="lazy" draggable="false"/></figure><div class="TruncatedText__container--HTs4n" id="text-content-:R1kpqd:"><input type="checkbox" class="TruncatedText__checkbox--VgXyK" id="read-more-toggle-:R1kpqd:" disabled=""/><div class="TruncatedText__text--jvlzh"><div><p>Koble til standard 22 kW* AC-lader på arbeidsplassen eller hjemme for å lade bilen når den står parkert. Og hvis du har dårlig tid? 150 kW DC-hurtigladeren er perfekt for rask batteriopplading på farten.</p><p>*kun tilgjengelig på Executive-variant</p></div></div></div></article><article class="HighlightsSlider__slide--HQmmc"><h3 class="Text__header-regular--ITTjn Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Toyota Teammate: Parker som en proff med Teammate</h3><figure><img src="https://t1-carassets.toyota-europe.com/36731f21-6ef0-44af-9d74-d513e345ce61.JPG" srcSet="https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/180X180/36731f21-6ef0-44af-9d74-d513e345ce61.webp 180w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/225X225/36731f21-6ef0-44af-9d74-d513e345ce61.webp 225w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/336X336/36731f21-6ef0-44af-9d74-d513e345ce61.webp 336w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/386X386/36731f21-6ef0-44af-9d74-d513e345ce61.webp 386w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/426X426/36731f21-6ef0-44af-9d74-d513e345ce61.webp 426w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/772X772/36731f21-6ef0-44af-9d74-d513e345ce61.webp 772w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/852X852/36731f21-6ef0-44af-9d74-d513e345ce61.webp 852w" alt="" role="presentation" loading="lazy" draggable="false"/></figure><div class="TruncatedText__container--HTs4n" id="text-content-:R1mpqd:"><input type="checkbox" class="TruncatedText__checkbox--VgXyK" id="read-more-toggle-:R1mpqd:" disabled=""/><div class="TruncatedText__text--jvlzh"><div><p>Toyota Teammate er kjørepartneren du ikke visste du trengte. Fra å utføre vanskelige manøvrer til å navigere i byen, er Teammate her for å hjelpe – tilbyr støtte og gir deg trygghet for en smidig og trygg kjøretur.</p></div></div></div></article><article class="HighlightsSlider__slide--HQmmc"><h3 class="Text__header-regular--ITTjn Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Varmeseter bak: Oppvarmede passasjerseter bak</h3><figure><img src="https://t1-carassets.toyota-europe.com/393fbeee-4772-4dd5-8abf-ac1597479d14.PNG" srcSet="https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/180X180/393fbeee-4772-4dd5-8abf-ac1597479d14.webp 180w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/225X225/393fbeee-4772-4dd5-8abf-ac1597479d14.webp 225w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/336X336/393fbeee-4772-4dd5-8abf-ac1597479d14.webp 336w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/386X386/393fbeee-4772-4dd5-8abf-ac1597479d14.webp 386w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/426X426/393fbeee-4772-4dd5-8abf-ac1597479d14.webp 426w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/772X772/393fbeee-4772-4dd5-8abf-ac1597479d14.webp 772w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/852X852/393fbeee-4772-4dd5-8abf-ac1597479d14.webp 852w" alt="" role="presentation" loading="lazy" draggable="false"/></figure><div class="TruncatedText__container--HTs4n" id="text-content-:R1opqd:"><input type="checkbox" class="TruncatedText__checkbox--VgXyK" id="read-more-toggle-:R1opqd:" disabled=""/><div class="TruncatedText__text--jvlzh"><div><p>Sørg for at passasjerene dine har det varmt i vintermånedene med oppvarmede bakseter – et energieffektivt alternativ til å skru opp varmeren – designet for å gi umiddelbar varme for en komfortabel kjøretur i kaldt vær.</p></div></div></div></article><article class="HighlightsSlider__slide--HQmmc"><h3 class="Text__header-regular--ITTjn Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Ventilasjon i forsetet: Gir deg komfort under hele kjøreturen</h3><figure><img src="https://t1-carassets.toyota-europe.com/c9d41cf2-b5c7-4eea-a167-be456a74f219.JPG" srcSet="https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/180X180/c9d41cf2-b5c7-4eea-a167-be456a74f219.webp 180w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/225X225/c9d41cf2-b5c7-4eea-a167-be456a74f219.webp 225w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/336X336/c9d41cf2-b5c7-4eea-a167-be456a74f219.webp 336w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/386X386/c9d41cf2-b5c7-4eea-a167-be456a74f219.webp 386w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/426X426/c9d41cf2-b5c7-4eea-a167-be456a74f219.webp 426w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/772X772/c9d41cf2-b5c7-4eea-a167-be456a74f219.webp 772w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/JPG/resize/852X852/c9d41cf2-b5c7-4eea-a167-be456a74f219.webp 852w" alt="" role="presentation" loading="lazy" draggable="false"/></figure><div class="TruncatedText__container--HTs4n" id="text-content-:R1qpqd:"><input type="checkbox" class="TruncatedText__checkbox--VgXyK" id="read-more-toggle-:R1qpqd:" disabled=""/><div class="TruncatedText__text--jvlzh"><div><p>Nyt luftige og luktfrie seter takket være ventilasjon i forsetet, som holder deg og passasjeren foran perfekt temperert ved å sirkulere luft gjennom setet.</p></div></div></div></article></div><div class="HighlightsSlider__slider-footer--SYzpP"><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">1 / 5</span><div class="HighlightsSlider__slider-buttons--O2XqD"><button type="button" class="Button__btn-arrow--W2kvL Button__btn-default--Zm4fj Button__circle--SrVMP HighlightsSlider__nav-button--aRHBb"><svg class="Icon__icon--gk3vW Icon__md--_2kiP Icon__icon--gk3vW Icon__icon-chevron-left--kdGPZ" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#chevron-left"></use></svg><span class="Accessibility__sr-only--Jea6c"><span>Forrige slide</span></span></button><button type="button" class="Button__btn-arrow--W2kvL Button__btn-default--Zm4fj Button__circle--SrVMP HighlightsSlider__nav-button--aRHBb"><svg class="Icon__icon--gk3vW Icon__md--_2kiP Icon__icon--gk3vW Icon__icon-chevron-right--xGAKo" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#chevron-right"></use></svg><span class="Accessibility__sr-only--Jea6c"><span>Neste slide</span></span></button></div></div></div></div><div class="SpecsAndHighlights__specs--xaNzY"><section id="carConfigSpecsSpaceAndRoom" aria-label="Plass" class="SpecsAndHighlights__specSection--L4JrO"><p class="Text__support-header-semibold--ok4zj Text__heading-global--rDWeu ColorTypes__grey-7--Vl83B"><span>Bilspesifikasjoner</span></p><h3 class="Text__header-regular--ITTjn Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Plass</h3><div class="SpecsDetail__wrapper--khN7a"><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu SpacingTypes__spacing-1--k_0RP">Stoffer av høy kvalitet og myk detaljer gir behagelige menneskelige preg til interiøret ditt, og forvandler kupeen til en innbydende plass der alle føler seg komfortable.</p><div class="SpecsDetail__grid--g7MDA"><div><div class="SpecsDetail__section--TmY19"><div><div class="SpecsDetail__subheader--VS97X"><h3 class="Text__header-body-regular--gyw4G Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Dimensjoner</h3></div><dl role="list"><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Lengde</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">4830 mm</p></dd></div><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Bredde</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">1860 mm</p></dd></div><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Høyde</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">1675 mm</p></dd></div><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Akselavstand</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">2850 mm</p></dd></div></dl></div><div><div class="SpecsDetail__subheader--VS97X"><h3 class="Text__header-body-regular--gyw4G Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Dimensjoner </h3></div><dl role="list"><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Seter</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">5 Seter</p></dd></div></dl></div><div><div class="SpecsDetail__subheader--VS97X"><h3 class="Text__header-body-regular--gyw4G Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Lastekapasitet</h3></div><dl role="list"><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Lastevolum</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">550 m³</p></dd></div><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Bagasjeromsvolum med tredje stolrad nedfelt, volum opp til tak</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">669 liter</p></dd></div><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">VDA bagasjeromsvolum, med bakseter oppslått</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">669 liter</p></dd></div></dl></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="carConfigSpecsEngine" aria-label="Elektrisk motor" class="SpecsAndHighlights__specSection--L4JrO"><h3 class="Text__